{"name": "The Da Vinci Cryptex 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras_big/4de174d0da39af192dd3c1343c73b2c2.avif?t=1785762187\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras/4de174d0da39af192dd3c1343c73b2c2.avif?t=1785762187\" width=\"1560\"/></span>The genial inventor is back with new logical enigmas written in a book! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the answers, unlock the Cryptex, and see what awaits you in the next level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras_big/d4f246e7486cd9027cf6b814dcffd775.avif?t=1785762187\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras/d4f246e7486cd9027cf6b814dcffd775.avif?t=1785762187\" width=\"1560\"/></span><strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex 2</strong> is a brainteasing game with 50 unique riddles. The more you solve them, the harder the puzzles become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warning</strong>: this IQ game may be addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras_big/a28580b7df979869251f2156c751af65.avif?t=1785762187\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras/a28580b7df979869251f2156c751af65.avif?t=1785762187\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- 50 unique handcrafted puzzles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Hints available (click the bulb button to get a hint) </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Astonishing graphics </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Captivating background music</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a fan of puzzles, word games, brain thinking, mind games, IQ logic riddles, and enigmas, <strong>The Da Vinci Cryptex</strong> is the game for you, have fun in your spare time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785762187\" height=\"234\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785762187\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Test your mind in this new adventure, a 3D point-and-click escape game. Crack unique puzzles inspired by da Vinci's inventions, search for hidden clues, and unravel historical mysteries across challenging levels.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717780/1b6f96ff61cb4b347e2df21c5d618db56a06a4cd/header.jpg?t=1785762187", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Strategy", "Software", "Board Game", "Point & Click", "Puzzle"], "developers": "XSGames", "publishers": "XSGames", "release_date": "Dec 14, 2023", "price": "$3.99", "appid": "2717780", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/70ZyWBMrVQ4", "first_seen": 1746835200.0, "review_rank": 1678}